\label{def:condEVar}

A jointly measurable function $f : \mathcal{X} \times \mathcal{Y} \to \mathbb{R}_{+, \infty}$ is a conditional e-variable for a set of Markov kernels $H \subseteq (\mathcal{X} \rightsquigarrow \mathcal{Y})$ if $f(x, \cdot)$ is in $\mathcal{E}_{H(x)}$ for all $x \in \mathcal{X}$ (in which $H(x) = \{\eta(x) \mid \eta \in H\}$).
